We finish the first game.
We step off the court.
I am very tired because of the game.
So I am going to drink some water.
I take my water bottle.
Vishnu, Sara, and Kiran also drink water.
Vishnu looks at me and smiles.
"Maya, do you like Kochi?" Vishnu asks.
"Do you like to live here?"
"Yes, I like this city very much," I reply.
"I really love to live in Kochi."
"I like to meet new friends very much."
"I am very happy to hear that," Vishnu says.
"We can play together again," Kiran says.
I nod happily.
We all rest for some time.
Then we go to play again.
